    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d672-a15">

                <pb facs="0828" n="734" xml:id="pg734"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 15 in No. 2987.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana Naval Prison</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1896-05-02"><hi rendition="#italic">May 2,
                                1896</hi></date>. (Received May 7.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I wish to know if you are aware that
                    three American citizens have been imprisoned here for some time. If so, please
                    inform me immediately.</p>
                <p>Relying on your wisdom and integrity, as well as the high esteem with which you
                    are held in the United States, I await your advice.</p>
                <p>Most respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ona Melton.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
